{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「百億富三代」鍾培生（Derek）今年3月在淺水灣大宅以電影級規格打造《進擊的巨人》場景，向莊雅婷（Angel）成功求婚，轟動全城。兩人於同年7月迎來愛女，升格為新手父母。兩人在現實生活中愛得甜蜜，也時常在社交平台放閃。日前鍾培生分享一段晚上11點炒飯給莊雅婷食的片段，完美展現愛妻號風範！</p><figure><img alt=\"「百億富四代」鍾培生與太太莊雅婷出雙入對。（葉志明、盧振輝 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172703278798999552479016.jpeg/yfj4GLsApCu2b14mvgLaMaXHcKo1yhWlc2VEr3NlRK8\"/><figcaption>「百億富四代」鍾培生與太太莊雅婷出雙入對。（葉志明、盧振輝 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾培生莊雅婷現實中時常放閃。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186746513796239360150637.png/cfsVfkwQFk9jVGx2n8RzfO0IIsNm7QThMSnJzTEpyc0\"/><figcaption>鍾培生莊雅婷現實中時常放閃。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><p>鍾培生11點炒飯予莊雅婷醫肚</p><p>鍾培生在Instagram分享影片。他透露：「老婆肚餓，11點幾話想食炒飯，整個XO醬鮑魚五香肉丁蛋炒飯！」鍾培生用力炒飯，有模有樣，更直言：「啱啱好屋企有隔夜飯，因為夠鑊氣！睇吓，炒到差唔多夠乾身。」貼心又細心！期間鍾培生不忘自誇：「Show the world what the champ is cooking!」煮到身水身汗展現愛妻一面，相信莊雅婷一定冧到十足！</p><figure><img alt=\"鍾培生炒飯給莊雅婷醫肚。（IG@khdcheung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198734305304776704015973.png/X1PxXZEOLG91_9Hc9BYHdTwnr96U2m0nciFLiXIhS4k\"/><figcaption>鍾培生炒飯給莊雅婷醫肚。（IG@khdcheung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾培生好愛莊雅婷！（IG@khdcheung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198734302599319552564072.png/7LXApPgmV_-HGzua7ovAoI7J_i8CN6mi2r2Q69q9kOs\"/><figcaption>鍾培生好愛莊雅婷！（IG@khdcheung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"正！（IG@khdcheung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198734299977748480132748.png/JGbFjJjQWGRmEMTHWiakhenFaZOtrjmFBgf4HwYH-B8\"/><figcaption>正！（IG@khdcheung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾培生巨舖開幕太太莊雅婷挺巨肚撐場。（資料圖片 / 葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260713/1153307263788650496589704.jpeg/_YsZwBdQo6IVyc1XLgFeXcynQyEWbAfnOXsL3Tl7C90\"/><figcaption>鍾培生巨舖開幕太太莊雅婷挺巨肚撐場。（資料圖片 / 葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"莊雅婷富貴行頭現身！（IG/@angel.cnt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260822/1167804156044644352714685.jpeg/hxZYax7xNXSRk0r51LTbf8kG6SZEm2QaWWTX51lk1-c\"/><figcaption>莊雅婷富貴行頭現身！（IG/@angel.cnt）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"莊雅婷大讚丈夫智商情商雙高。（IG@angel.cnt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260930/1181998097581084672781053.jpeg/yc5x1mAUiTpupxdtE7qe0vP4Bmrh1NU8332e_999nv8\"/><figcaption>莊雅婷大讚丈夫智商情商雙高。（IG@angel.cnt）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾培生向莊雅婷求婚成功，場面震撼。（鍾培生FB）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260305/1106256534473674752892730.jpeg/KM-vMCgqEZ5ofi14pJzmeL-mUHgNtYEkB0saYQdLGmE\"/><figcaption>鍾培生向莊雅婷求婚成功，場面震撼。（鍾培生FB）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾培生向莊雅婷求婚成功，場面震撼。（鍾培生FB）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260305/1106256532250562560483217.jpeg/asrilriYZEV8Sbshrc5LctUTPeqtl7j-yr_nycq_58k\"/><figcaption>鍾培生向莊雅婷求婚成功，場面震撼。（鍾培生FB）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T16:24:51.170407+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":605,"images":10,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T15:55:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T16:38:11.845323+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T16:17:51.285958+00:00","content_hash":"a23a466e4d4942192b8ee2d504b4f4cb72c93e9a50bee50afcbea6fe5a99e024","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}